2026-10-13T11:19:43.5296646Z                         storage backend: storage backend path; may be
2026-10-13T11:19:43.5296953Z                         repeated.
2026-10-13T11:19:43.5297270Z   --model MODEL         model directory (or config.json) for model-driven
2026-10-13T11:19:43.5297686Z                         mode. When set, shard-size/shard-number/block-number
2026-10-13T11:19:43.5298081Z                         are computed from the model config and override any
2026-10-13T11:19:43.5298426Z                         manually provided values.
2026-10-13T11:19:43.5298773Z   --tp TP               tensor parallel size; divides num_kv_heads per rank
